@page "/management"
@model Foodeaz.Web.Pages.ManagementModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Management"; }








    <!-- main -->
    <main class="subpage">
        
        
        <!-- sub page header -->
        <section class="subpage-header management-header">
            <div class="container">
                 <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <h5 class="h6 text-uppercase position-relative">The Leaders</h5>
                        <h1 class="h1 fbold">Management</h1>                       
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <!--/ sub page heder -->

         <!-- sub page body -->
         <section class="subpage-body">
            <div class="custom-container">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-4">
                        <img src="/img/founder.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-8 align-self-center">
                        <h5 class="h6 text-uppercase fbold">Founder Note</h5>
                        <h2 class="h2">Dr. Niharika Gourineni </h2>
                        <p>My aim is always upward bringing of underprivileged women andsupporting them in all possible ways to create self-sustainability and selfreliance. By empowering women to become business owners, I believe we can create a more equitable and inclusive economy. I am proud to be part of a growing movement of women entrepreneurs who are breaking barriers and creating new pathways for future generations.</p>
                        <p>I believe that franchising offers a unique and powerful way for women to achieve their entrepreneurial aspirations. Through franchising, women can tap into a proven business model, receive training and support, and benefit from the brand recognition and marketing power of a larger organization.</p>
                        <p>In conclusion, as a woman founder, I am passionate about creating opportunities for other women to succeed and thrive. By providing franchise opportunities, I am confident that we can make a positive impact on the lives of women and the communities they serve. </p>

                        <h2 class="h2 pt-3">Our Aim</h2>
                        <p>We aim to empower women, unemployed and support economic sustainability by creating a world where affordable franchise business opportunities are accessible to everyone, regardless of their background or financial situation. We also aim at creating culture where women and unemployed would become self-reliant entrepreneurs by investing small amounts.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
         </section>
        <!--/ sub page body -->

    </main>
    <!--/ main -->

    <!-- footer -->
    
    <!--/ footer -->
    


